THEORY Ex5Q1
IMPORT-THEORY Equality
IMPORT-THEORY Boolean
IMPORT-THEORY Arithmetic
IMPORT-THEORY List
IMPORT-HASKELL List
IMPORT-HASKELL Ex5
THEOREM ex5q1
   (1 * (x - (y - z))) + (0 * 1) == (0 * 1) + (((z + x) - y) - 0)

STRATEGY ReduceAll
    (1 * (x - (y - z))) + (0 * 1) == (0 * 1) + (((z + x) - y) - 0)
    = LAW mul_left_unit l2r @ * 1
    (x - (y - z)) + (0 * 1) == (0 * 1) + (((z + x) - y) - 0)
    = NORM +
    (0 * 1) + (x - (y - z)) == (0 * 1) + (((x + z) - y) - 0)
    = LAW sub_right_unit l2r @ - 4
    (0 * 1) + (x - (y - z)) == (0 * 1) + ((x + z) - y)
    = LAW add_sub_assoc2 l2r @ - 3
    (0 * 1) + (x - (y - z)) == (0 * 1) + (x - (y - z))
    = LAW eq_refl
    True
END ReduceAll
QED ex5q1